Package: diode-failure-detector
Version: 5.1.0
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Natska Natsagnyam NAMKHAI <natska@example.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libm6 | libc6
Description: Diode failure detector for synchronous brushless excitation control system
 A Linux kernel module and real-time Rust eGUI telemetry application 
 for brushless alternator excitation control and diode failure monitoring.
